    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prime Residential Development Opportunity – Dublin 14\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to acquire a site with full planning permission for a detached 2-bedroom residence with attic room extending to approximately 104 sq.m. in Dublin 14.\r\n\r\nSituated in a well-established and highly sought-after residential area of Dublin 14, this development site offers purchasers the opportunity to build a modern, energy-efficient home in a location that combines convenience, connectivity and strong long-term demand.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nFull planning permission for an end of terrace 2-bedroom house (approx. 104 sq.m.)\r\nPrime Dublin 14 location in a mature residential neighborhood\r\nWalking distance to schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and local amenities\r\nExcellent public transport links with regular bus services providing direct access to Dublin City Centre\r\nConvenient access to major transport routes including the M50 and N7\r\nStrong owner-occupier and investment appeal\r\nOpportunity to construct a contemporary home in an established community\r\nAll the benefits of city living while enjoying a residential setting\r\n\r\nDevelopment sites with full planning permission in central Dublin locations are becoming increasingly scarce, making this an attractive opportunity for builders, investors and those looking to create their own home.\r\n\r\nPlanning documentation and further details available upon request."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Full planning permission granted for a 2-bedroom residential dwelling circa 104sq.mt\r\nPrime Dublin 14 location \r\nExcellent transport links with easy access to the city centre, M50, Luas and multiple Dublin Bus routes.\r\nOpportunity to create a modern, energy-efficient home tailored to current market requirements."
      }
    ],
